<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incesto</span></b> , āvi, 1, v.
			a.
		incestus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to pollute</i>, <i>defile</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totamque incestat funere classem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 6, 150</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 5, 5, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">diem (Furiae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Th. 11, 120</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Claud. Cons. Mall. Theod.
			267</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In partic., <i>to dishonor</i>, <i>defile</i> with lust: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puellam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 5, 2, 136</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">filiam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">thalamos novercae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 389</span></i>
			. 
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
